# The app's public address (./amc public on), served to the Cloudflare
# tunnel. cloudflared (compose.tunnel.yml) forwards visitors' requests here
# over the compose network; this port is not published, so no browser
# reaches it directly.
#
# Cloudflare has already handled HTTPS. It puts the visitor's address in
# CF-Connecting-IP, replacing any value the browser sent; X-Forwarded-For
# isn't usable, as Cloudflare keeps what the browser put there.
http://{$AMC_PUBLIC_HOST}:8091 {
	import amc {http.request.header.CF-Connecting-IP}
}
